; The posting date in a note after `= AMOUNT` sets the cutoff of a
; balance assertion.  As of 2021/03/01 the account holds 12 r, so
; asserting 17 r (its balance on the transaction's own date) fails.

2021/01/01 Opening
    Assets:Bank                       10 r
    Equity:Opening

2021/03/15 Deposit
    Assets:Bank                        5 r
    Income:Salary

2021/04/01 Reconcile
    Assets:Bank                        2 r = 17 r ; [2021/03/01]
    Income:Interest

test bal Assets -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 14:
While parsing posting:
  Assets:Bank                        2 r = 17 r ; [2021/03/01]
                                           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
Error: Balance assertion off by 5 r (expected to see 12 r)
end test
